--- !u!114 &1254348659
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1254348658}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 42448278}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp-Editor::BackstoryManager
  phishermanImage: {fileID: 1968043152}
  dadImage: {fileID: 1556200511}
  backgroundImage: {fileID: 1225111244}
  speakerText: {fileID: 766387254}
  bodyText: {fileID: 1967559966}
  continueHint: {fileID: 560639494}
  advanceButton: {fileID: 846549511}
  skipButton: {fileID: 529069840}
  canvasGroup: {fileID: 763110484}
  fadeDuration: 0.5
  portraitFade: 0.28
  nextScene: WorldMap
  lines:
  - text: A quiet fishing town. A family that worked hard for everything they had.
    speaker: 
    phishermanSprite: {fileID: -444972390392551945, guid: 5510ad8372f10e7459b0f2d7901dbf28, type: 3}
    showDad: 0
    bgTint: {r: 0.023529412, g: 0.047058824, b: 0.101960786, a: 1}
  - text: 'One evening, Phisherman''s father received an email.

      "Congratulations!
      You''ve won a prize. Click here to claim."'
    speaker: 
    phishermanSprite: {fileID: -444972390392551945, guid: 5510ad8372f10e7459b0f2d7901dbf28, type: 3}
    showDad: 0
    bgTint: {r: 0.023529412, g: 0.047058824, b: 0.101960786, a: 1}
  - text: He clicked the link. He filled in his details. He lost everything.
    speaker: 
    phishermanSprite: {fileID: 5067566706209844447, guid: 9c8dec226527e1949884f8e8390e564b, type: 3}
    showDad: 0
    bgTint: {r: 0.050980393, g: 0.105882354, b: 0.18039216, a: 1}
  - text: Dad, it was a scam. They tricked you into giving them your bank details.
    speaker: Phisherman
    phishermanSprite: {fileID: 5067566706209844447, guid: 9c8dec226527e1949884f8e8390e564b, type: 3}
    showDad: 1
    bgTint: {r: 0.050980393, g: 0.105882354, b: 0.18039216, a: 1}
  - text: I know, son. I should have known better. But it looked so real...
    speaker: Father
    phishermanSprite: {fileID: 5067566706209844447, guid: 9c8dec226527e1949884f8e8390e564b, type: 3}
    showDad: 1
    bgTint: {r: 0.050980393, g: 0.105882354, b: 0.18039216, a: 1}
  - text: That's what they count on. They study us. They know exactly what will make
      us trust them.
    speaker: Phisherman
    phishermanSprite: {fileID: 5067566706209844447, guid: 9c8dec226527e1949884f8e8390e564b, type: 3}
    showDad: 1
    bgTint: {r: 0.039215688, g: 0.078431375, b: 0.15686275, a: 1}
  - text: He stood at the water's edge and made a promise to himself.
    speaker: 
    phishermanSprite: {fileID: 1206890091779780711, guid: 5e766a4ce730fc74eb613babbadd4e23, type: 3}
    showDad: 0
    bgTint: {r: 0.039215688, g: 0.078431375, b: 0.15686275, a: 1}
  - text: No one else in this town would fall for this. Not on my watch.
    speaker: Phisherman
    phishermanSprite: {fileID: 1206890091779780711, guid: 5e766a4ce730fc74eb613babbadd4e23, type: 3}
    showDad: 0
    bgTint: {r: 0.039215688, g: 0.078431375, b: 0.15686275, a: 1}
  - text: I'm going to learn every trick they use. And I'm going to teach everyone
      I know.
    speaker: Phisherman
    phishermanSprite: {fileID: 1206890091779780711, guid: 5e766a4ce730fc74eb613babbadd4e23, type: 3}
    showDad: 0
    bgTint: {r: 0.039215688, g: 0.078431375, b: 0.15686275, a: 1}
  - text: 'The Phisherman had found his purpose.


      And the town would never
      be the same.'
    speaker: 
    phishermanSprite: {fileID: 1206890091779780711, guid: 5e766a4ce730fc74eb613babbadd4e23, type: 3}
    showDad: 0
    bgTint: {r: 0.039215688, g: 0.078431375, b: 0.15686275, a: 1}
